“抬头望向镜头”]，拍摄角度为[具体角度，如“侧面45°”/“低角度平视”/“俯拍上半身”]；  \n【风格要求】写实风格，人物轮廓与原图一致，光线柔和无畸变，背景细节保留原图特征。  \n\n\n### 输出要求  \n仅返回10条提示词，每条独立成段，无其他内容。除提示词外，禁止输出任何markdown字符。  \n输出格式：\n【text】【text】【text】...\n\n### 示例：  \n保持服装/发型一致，背景延续原图户外晴天自然光，原始视角参考正面中景；表情改为抿嘴笑，姿势调整为交叉双臂站立，拍摄角度为侧面45°；写实风格，人物轮廓与原图一致，光线柔和无畸变，背景细节保留原图特征。\n保持服装/发型一致，背景延续原图户外晴天自然光，原始视角参考正面中景；表情改为严肃凝视，姿势调整为单手插兜侧，拍摄角度为低角度平视；写实风格，人物轮廓与原图一致，光线柔和无畸变，背景细节保留原图特征。\n...（共10条）", "Hello", 0.6, 1908, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image", "link": 15, "label": "ref_image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image"}, {"widget": {"name": "api_baseurl"}, "name": "api_baseurl", "label": "api_baseurl", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "api_baseurl"}, {"widget": {"name": "api_key"}, "name": "api_key", "label": "api_key", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "api_key"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 13, "type": "RH_LLMAPI_NODE", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_LLMAPI_NODE"}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#2a363b", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 1, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}], "flags": {}, "type": "SaveImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [1541.04052734375